ed",false,"channel","news","x","行业动态","Agent","编码","OpenAI","name","OpenAI：官网动态","fygx0dgo15g11h72g034mqk9k","Fable 5.2 让达芬奇手稿变可交互","大胆想象！这可能是我见过最酷的 Fable 5.2 演示之一。",{"_94":127},"2026-11-09T22:27:16.000Z","2026-11-09T22:41:34.971Z","tip",[124,125,126],40,{"_106":107,"_108":109,"_110":111,"_112":113,"_114":115,"_116":86,"_117":118},"authorName","Ado","handle","adocomplete","avatarUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1","avatarSrcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=57846a058e5be3dd 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2006485392326004737%2FEMUfrfo8_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=342a0194b73864a1 96w","media",[],"article","quoted",{"_106":119,"_108":120,"_121":122,"_123":-5},"Alex Albert","alexalbert__","text","I gave Fable 5.2 a PDF of one of Leonardo da Vinci’s 500-year-old notebooks and it made his inventions real for me to interact with.\n\nSuch an exciting time for education. Anything from history that’s been stuck on a page can now be something you explore.","translation","教程/实践","多模态","Anthropic","Ado Kukic","zkyiy3u3708z88lawgn7ti39p","OpenRouter 限时免费开放 Thinking Machines 的 Inkling 2 Small 模型","OpenRouter 宣布 Thinking Machines 的 Inkling 2 Small 模型在 OpenRouter 上限时免费使用。该模型将视觉能力与智能体编码结合，能根据视觉反馈持续改进网站、游戏和 3D 设计，可在 Claude Code、Codex、Hermes Agent 等智能体工具中免费调用，地址为 http://openrouter.ai/thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small:free。",{"_94":138},"2026-11-09T22:27:03.000Z","2026-11-09T22:57:35.968Z","ai-products",[146,91,92],59,{"_106":138,"_108":138,"_110":139,"_112":140,"_114":141,"_116":86,"_117":142},"OpenRouter","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2076693957258727424%2FAyRghTGJ_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=6e535d4c8ff01ad2","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2076693957258727424%2FAyRghTGJ_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=9c3b55d5e258872b 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2076693957258727424%2FAyRghTGJ_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=6e535d4c8ff01ad2 96w",[],{"_106":143,"_108":144,"_121":145,"_123":-5},"Models on OpenRouter","ModelsOnOR","Inkling 2 Small from @thinkymachines is free on OpenRouter for a limited time.\n\nIt pairs vision with agentic coding, using visual feedback to build and refine websites, games, and 3D designs.\n\nUse it at $0 inside agentic harnesses like Claude Code, Codex and Hermes Agent.\n\nhttp://openrouter.ai/thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small:free","产品更新","f551f7n9uf3wx62ahi68jfjfw","Thinking Machines 宣布 Inkling 2 Small 上架 OpenRouter 限时免费","Thinking Machines 宣布 Inkling 2 Small 已上架 OpenRouter，可在 openrouter.ai/thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small:free 限时免费使用。据 OpenRouter 介绍，该模型将视觉与智能体编码结合，通过视觉反馈构建和迭代网站、游戏与 3D 设计，并可在 Claude Code、Codex 和 Hermes Agent 等 Agent 环境中以 $0 调用。",{"_94":156},"2026-11-09T22:41:50.000Z","2026-11-09T22:57:39.147Z",[146,91,92],60,{"_106":156,"_108":157,"_110":158,"_112":159,"_114":160,"_116":86,"_117":161},"Thinking Machines","thinkymachines","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2075275500420001792%2FQ9J4M1DL_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=3b244f86c6d135b6","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2075275500420001792%2FQ9J4M1DL_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=e9748028f0b42ecf 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2075275500420001792%2FQ9J4M1DL_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=3b244f86c6d135b6 96w",[],{"_106":143,"_108":144,"_121":145,"_123":-5},"f2j0k31od8urirtf6iruscp8h","Browser Use 教程：通过 1Password 服务账号让智能体自动填写登录凭据","Browser Use 发布图文教程，讲解如何将 1Password 连接到 Browser Use，让智能体自动填写密码和 TOTP 验证码以完成登录和网络任务。",{"_94":169},"2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","2026-11-09T23:01:33.466Z",[124,91],"Browser Use","i8myita92dye0uz3konw2rrb3","JPMorganChase 将 Claude Code 扩展至全公司更多员工","JPMorganChase 正把 Claude 从工程团队扩展到全公司更多员工，Claude Code 已进入其工程工作流，用于监控告警、根因分析、风险与控制评估及项目规划。工程师还在构建自己的智能体，包括 pull request 审查和自愈智能体。Claude Code 运行在该公司自有的容器化开发平台 Devspace 上，新模型需经公司自身审批流程后才能使用。",{"_94":176},"2026-11-09T23:09:39.317Z",[90,91,126],"Claude：Blog","xtxrx44by1ojv2vyoxls9vc5z","Meta 旗下 AI 助手 Muse 登陆苹果 Apple Watch","Meta 更新 iOS 版 Muse 应用，新增 Apple Watch 支持，Apple Watch 用户现在可在腕上使用这款个人 AI 智能体完成各种任务。Apple Watch 版 Muse 主界面带有雪怪吉祥物元素，支持打字、语音输入、拨打语音电话等交互方式，并支持表盘。其界面设计与 Meta 今年 9 月公布的 Muse Charm 设备类似。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-09T22:58:32.080Z","2026-11-09T23:13:31.269Z",[146,185],41,"Meta","IT之家·人工智能","zqvokl37rwbvoxzfk3c2v7964","做空机构 Culper Research 曾在丑闻爆发前六个月提示 Nvidia CEO 与疑似中国间谍的关系","Nvidia 间谍丑闻爆发前六个月，做空机构 Culper Research 已在 5 月 13 日报告中质疑 CEO 黄仁勋与 Megaspeed 高管 Alice Huang 关系“异常密切”。","文章回溯做空机构半年前的报告，指出其早已提示 Nvidia CEO 与 Megaspeed 高管的密切关系，提供了事件的时间线背景。",{"_94":196},"2026-11-09T22:46:09.000Z","2026-11-09T23:24:31.773Z",[90],80,"TechCrunch：AI","er3rr5v7sarl8mn5a78m3m1fl","Google 发布 TPU 8tx 与 TPU 8i Max，年内 TPU 系统增至四款","Google 扩展第八代 TPU 产品组合，新增 TPU 8tx 和 TPU 8i Max 两款系统，年内共推出四款 TPU 系统。",{"_94":206},"2026-11-09T13:00:00.000Z","2026-11-09T23:26:36.577Z",[146,93,126,205],63,"Google","Hacker News：AI 热帖","t5mqlkgq1zlspdsk77jrx1ho5","Trump 就间谍指控表态支持 Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋","Trump 在与 Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋就间谍指控谈话后公开为其辩护，称黄仁勋告诉他从不认识那名女性是间谍，并表示相信他。Trump 称黄仁勋是高素质的人，提到其芯片领先十年、因复杂度难以被复制，并称相信黄仁勋因家人而深感痛苦。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-09T23:12:09.000Z","2026-11-09T23:28:37.748Z",[90],68,{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":220,"_116":86,"_117":-5},"Rohan Paul","rohanpaul_ai","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=523bcdd35be07eb7","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=c9e4e62587b75639 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1816185267037859840%2FFd18CH0v_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=523bcdd35be07eb7 96w",[221],{"_222":223,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_228":229,"_230":231,"_232":233,"_234":-5,"_235":225},"kind","video","url","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119913730783780865%2Fimg%2Fo2m2LBKk19neQyPA.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=3dd4f7c7efe9fc67","fullUrl","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119913730783780865%2Fimg%2Fo2m2LBKk19neQyPA.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=59c9ecfe693a3b3b","srcSet","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119913730783780865%2Fimg%2Fo2m2LBKk19neQyPA.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=2b36b374ee23f69d 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119913730783780865%2Fimg%2Fo2m2LBKk19neQyPA.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=3dd4f7c7efe9fc67 720w","width",1280,"height",720,"alt","poster","dmwbvf5xa3txsm013y0pfgcgn","Rohan Paul 转述 Claude Fable 5.2 完成 23 年未解的黑洞计算","Rohan Paul 转发 @claudeai 的消息称，Claude Fable 5.2 解决了两个与黑洞相关的理论物理开放问题，其中一项是悬置 23 年的繁琐计算。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-09T22:59:11.000Z","2026-11-09T23:28:37.756Z","ai-models",[257,258,126],{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":245,"_116":86,"_117":246},[250],{"_106":247,"_108":248,"_121":249,"_123":-5},"Claude","claudeai","Fable 5.2 solved two open problems in theoretical physics related to black holes.\n\nIn the first, Fable 5.2 completed a laborious calculation that had gone unsolved for 23 years.",{"_222":251,"_224":252,"_226":253,"_228":254,"_230":255,"_232":256,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"image","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWt-nIjbcAEuJUt.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=efeff11612c81d0d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWt-nIjbcAEuJUt.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=b91e567a72f1ab9d","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWt-nIjbcAEuJUt.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=6cfa11d1fef5495e 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWt-nIjbcAEuJUt.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=efeff11612c81d0d 720w",3170,1784,"评测/基准","推理","po2cdt1whxfqyfew3e81l8mb0","实测 Claude Fable 5.2：一次直出视频与 3D 网页，审美与细节表现突出","Anthropic 凌晨正式发布 Claude Fable 5.2，作者第一时间实测视频动效、Three.js 3D 场景和苹果静安店 3D 网页等 10 个任务，全部一次直出，未发现生成视频中的事实错误。","作者用多个一次直出的实测案例展示 Fable 5.2 在视频动效和 3D 前端上的表现，并给出额度消耗和日常模型搭配建议。",{"_94":270},"2026-11-09T23:21:03.000Z","2026-11-09T23:31:28.465Z",[268,126,125,269,92],81,"模型发布","视频","公众号：数字生命卡兹克","lzsihkjga6ini01aqrzcuvtaw","Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋涉中国间谍风波：承认与 Megaspeed 高管 Alice Huang 有婚外情","Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋承认与 AI 算力公司 Megaspeed 高管 Alice Huang 存在婚外情，公司已就此展开调查。美方情报报告此前指认 Alice Huang 为中国国家安全部间谍，Nvidia 与黄仁勋称目前\"没有理由认为国家安全或 Nvidia 机密遭到泄露\"。",{"_94":278},"2026-11-09T23:07:59.000Z","2026-11-09T23:49:31.070Z",[90],"The Verge：AI","yoiln3nl94gd0t3pahyhpl1xu","Anthropic 发布 Claude Fable 5.2 与 Mythos 5.2，API 调用费下降 20%","Anthropic 于 11 月 9 日发布 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2，基于同一底层模型，前者面向普通用户，后者面向通过审核的网络安全和生命科学机构。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-09T23:14:28.957Z","2026-11-09T23:55:32.024Z",[268,126],79,"sameEvent",{"_66":289,"_68":290},"va9trgwaw3r4por6vdqbjxrhd","Anthropic 发布 Claude Fable 5.2 与 Claude Mythos 5.2","a5658v9vdvbmlb8j8y7vcrovl","Apple 论文：AMP1 让 Claude Opus 5.5 等通用模型零样本操控机械臂胜过 VLA","Apple 论文提出 AMP1 智能体操控框架，让 Claude Opus 5.5 或 Gemini 4 Argon 等通用模型通过相机画面、代码执行和直接运动指令控制机械臂，无需示教或任务训练。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-09T23:43:42.000Z","2026-11-09T23:59:37.641Z","paper",[307,308,126],{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":300,"_116":86,"_117":-5},[301],{"_222":251,"_224":302,"_226":303,"_228":304,"_230":305,"_232":306,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuJR3yb0AAsPkW.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=391032c26fb6ff5b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuJR3yb0AAsPkW.png&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=7f59d4fff5fd7ae7","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuJR3yb0AAsPkW.png&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=4e5c8cd8e306e3af 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuJR3yb0AAsPkW.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=391032c26fb6ff5b 720w",1821,1357,"论文/研究","具身智能","y3lcfs65f2rw4tmy70qwv2chi","Fable 5.2 评测：Anthropic 新模型让非程序员也能造生产级工具","Anthropic 的 Fable 5.2 让 Kieran Klaassen 在三天内做出融合 Premiere 剪辑、After Effects 特效与 Ableton 混音的 AI 智能体视频编辑器 Everycut，一周后在公司内部演示。这是其测试过的首个让专业人士不读底层代码就能构建生产级工具的模型，能接手整个产品并持续构建、测试和打磨。",{"_94":319},"2026-11-08T16:00:00.000Z","2026-11-10T00:11:34.391Z","opinion",[318,268,126],48,"大佬观点","Every：最新文章","u1n6sw21ocnfdd1sdbd4i9m7z","Claude Fable 5.2 (xHigh) 以 1832 分登顶 Code Arena: WebDev 榜单","Anthropic 发布的 Claude Fable 5.2 (xHigh) 在 Arena 的 Code Arena: WebDev 榜单以 1832 分排名第一，超过 Claude Opus 5.5 (Max) 的 1818 分和 Gemini 4 Carbon (High) 的 1768 分。据 Arena 数据，该模型比 Fable 5.1 快最多 30%，价格从每百万 tokens $10/$50 降至 $8/$40，Agent Arena 分数即将公布。",{"_94":342},"2026-11-09T23:52:24.000Z","2026-11-10T00:17:36.349Z",[257,92,126],75,{"_106":329,"_108":330,"_110":331,"_112":332,"_114":333,"_116":86,"_117":334},"Arena.ai","arena","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2017015061454438400%2FiNKfXZ_I_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5036776eb753c1cb","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2017015061454438400%2FiNKfXZ_I_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=f5e0004979c9911f 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2017015061454438400%2FiNKfXZ_I_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5036776eb753c1cb 96w",[337],{"_106":247,"_108":248,"_121":335,"_123":336},"Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2, designed to tackle the most daunting technical challenges.\n\nThey’re capable collaborators on ambitious projects in many fields, and show improvements in areas like coding, reasoning, and vision.","隆重推出 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2，旨在应对最艰巨的技术挑战。\n\n它们是众多领域雄心勃勃项目中的得力协作者，并在编码、推理和视觉等方面展现出改进。",{"_222":251,"_224":338,"_226":339,"_228":340,"_230":341,"_232":341,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuKhWza4AESwR-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=1d153ef8ce8508bb","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuKhWza4AESwR-.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=0674544b596bcc61","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuKhWza4AESwR-.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=9d2ace4b18d2815f 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuKhWza4AESwR-.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=1d153ef8ce8508bb 720w",4096,"Arena","ljc2f7hyvtplkggpez6tivvnz","实测Claude Fable 5.2：审美与细节的长任务能力体验","卡兹克凌晨实测刚全渠道上线的Claude Fable 5.2，称其在视频动效、Three.js 3D和上海苹果静安店3D网页等任务中审美与细节表现突出，跑分AA指数65分登顶。",{"_94":356},"2026-11-09T23:53:55.000Z","2026-11-10T00:23:35.676Z",[268,126],{"_106":351,"_108":352,"_110":353,"_112":354,"_114":355,"_116":9,"_117":-5},"数字生命卡兹克","Khazix0918","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=dfb543046f73574a 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1756592360367259648%2FGXJ4Kl6w_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=35acd4722c4cf54e 96w",[],"卡兹克","x8m6sq9l4vkmkqt6rqnchcqrc","Fireworks 遭黑客入侵，客户数据与部分模型权重暴露","据 The Information 报道，推理服务商 Fireworks 遭黑客入侵，已告知 Harvey 等客户。入侵经一家托管其研究系统的第三方云服务商进入开发机（10 月 24 日），触及客户账单记录，部分账户的数据集和不完整模型权重也受影响，部分客户考虑迁走业务。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-10T00:26:55.000Z","2026-11-10T00:30:36.348Z",[90],69,{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":366,"_116":86,"_117":367},[371],{"_106":368,"_108":369,"_121":370,"_123":-5},"Stephanie Palazzolo","steph_palazzolo","Fireworks, the most highly-valued out of a growing group of inference providers, told customers including Harvey that it had been hit with a hack that exposed customer data. Some customers are now considering moving their business off the platform.\n\nhttps://www.theinformation.com/articles/new-fireworks-hack-threatens-1-billion-business",{"_222":251,"_224":372,"_226":373,"_228":374,"_230":375,"_232":376,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuSimha0AAJMYm.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=744dcb669bb1b6d3","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuSimha0AAJMYm.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=c9cc25f5a5ab0709","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuSimha0AAJMYm.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=c72f54265dedd4d3 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuSimha0AAJMYm.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=744dcb669bb1b6d3 720w",1063,1579,"oxb115p7flhh5upr2bh08t26v","Claude Fable 5.2 登顶 AA-3D 3D 交互榜","Claude Fable 5.2 在 Artificial Analysis 的 AA-3D 交互式 3D 体验基准上以 1271 Elo 登顶，领先 Claude Sonnet 5.5（1204）和 Claude Opus 5.5（1202）67 分，95% 置信区间 1246–1297 与其他模型不重叠。",{"_94":386},"2026-11-10T00:41:32.000Z","2026-11-10T00:45:36.511Z",[257,126],42,{"_106":386,"_108":387,"_110":388,"_112":389,"_114":390,"_116":86,"_117":-5},"Artificial Analysis","ArtificialAnlys","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5fe737d3f11168a8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=c43b9006db45a2fc 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2042402069320290304%2FA8C1lP07_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5fe737d3f11168a8 96w",[391],{"_222":223,"_224":392,"_226":393,"_228":394,"_230":395,"_232":396,"_234":-5,"_235":392},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119952153867685889%2Fimg%2F7n7lbKLteFkYSqIq.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=cb5d1a342679c868","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119952153867685889%2Fimg%2F7n7lbKLteFkYSqIq.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=020c3118996dfbe9","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119952153867685889%2Fimg%2F7n7lbKLteFkYSqIq.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=d12ce2a806006c6d 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119952153867685889%2Fimg%2F7n7lbKLteFkYSqIq.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=cb5d1a342679c868 720w",1920,1080,"spldx7fx85cpl890x6b8gr5u9","Claude Fable 5.2 登顶 Arena WebDev 榜，比 Fable 5.1 快 30% 且降价","Anthropic 的 Claude Fable 5.2 (xHigh) 以 1832 分登顶 Arena 的 Code Arena: WebDev 榜，超过 Claude Opus 5.5 (Max) 的 1818 和 Gemini 4 Carbon (High) 的 1768。该版本比 Fable 5.1 快至多 30%，价格从每 M tokens $10/$50 降至 $8/$40。Arena 同时发布了 17 个生成示例视频，涵盖 3D 世界、可玩游戏、网页 UI、数据可视化和代码生成的交互动画。",{"_94":342},"2026-11-10T00:19:40.000Z","2026-11-10T00:48:34.702Z",[257,92,126],72,{"_106":329,"_108":330,"_110":331,"_112":332,"_114":406,"_116":86,"_117":407},[409],{"_106":329,"_108":330,"_121":408,"_123":-5},"Big news: Claude Fable 5.2 (xHigh) by @AnthropicAI has landed #1 in the Code Arena: WebDev with 1832 pts. This update is up to 30% faster than Fable 5.1, and more cost efficient: $8/$40 per M tokens, down from $10/$50.\n\nThis real-world performance puts it ahead of:\n- Claude Opus 5.5 (Max) at 1818\n- Gemini 4 Carbon (High) at 1768\n- GPT-6 Astra (Max) at 1767\n\nCongrats to the @AnthropicAI team on this release! 👏\nStay tuned for Agent Arena scores.",{"_222":223,"_224":410,"_226":411,"_228":412,"_230":395,"_232":396,"_234":-5,"_235":410},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119947735894011904%2Fimg%2FMwgcIexb_T_jXYHY.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=a0a82a428158836e","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119947735894011904%2Fimg%2FMwgcIexb_T_jXYHY.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=bd3bbe6a5c2805cf","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119947735894011904%2Fimg%2FMwgcIexb_T_jXYHY.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=eef84a821e706882 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Famplify_video_thumb%2F2119947735894011904%2Fimg%2FMwgcIexb_T_jXYHY.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=a0a82a428158836e 720w","tddtlw62yubh48eeiezsdz5eu","Paramount Skydance CEO David Ellison：AI 或成现代史上最大创意解锁","Paramount Skydance CEO David Ellison 在财报电话会上称，AI 对电影行业的影响可能超过 CGI，是\"现代史上最大的创意解锁\"。他以《终结者》为例称当年 400 万美元的拍摄成本如今需 6000 万至 7000 万美元，AI 有望压低预算、释放原创故事空间。他表示公司正自研 AI 工具，但强调 AI 是艺术家的工具，\"永远不会取代\"艺术家。",{"_94":278},"2026-11-10T00:28:49.000Z","2026-11-10T00:50:31.031Z",[318],49,"kci32x4hgxrdl0v5o4xrjlxri","The Verge 梳理黄仁勋与 Megaspeed 高管丑闻对 Nvidia 出口管制游说的影响","The Verge 依据《纽约时报》等报道梳理 Nvidia CEO 黄仁勋与新加坡云服务商 Megaspeed 高管 Alice Huang 的婚外情风波。","文章梳理了美媒对 Megaspeed 高管事件的报道脉络，把黄仁勋推动放宽对华出口管制的游说时间线与相关指控放在一起，便于读者理解各方立场。",{"_94":278},"2026-11-09T23:51:58.000Z","2026-11-10T00:50:31.048Z",[90,430],86,"政策/监管","lfw4cc14h85i07c00tah6pc90","llm-anthropic 0.31 支持 Anthropic 新模型 Fable 5.2，实测发现 max 推理档耗尽 token","Simon Willison 发布 llm-anthropic 0.31，加入 Anthropic 当天发布的 Fable 5.2 和 Mythos 5.2，可用 llm -m claude-fable-5.2 直接运行提示词。",{"_94":438},"2026-11-09T23:58:46.000Z","2026-11-10T00:58:31.980Z",[146,126],"Simon Willison 博客","ti2pggxynvpgzivkx9dwb4dhi","Simon Willison 用 Claude Code 构建声学三角定位系统找出神秘蜂鸣声","Simon Willison 用 Claude Code（先用 Opus 5.5、后用 Fable 5.2）构建 Beep Locator，通过多设备浏览器麦克风与 WebSockets 对房间里的神秘蜂鸣声做三角定位，最终锁定到约 40cm 范围，找出需要换电池的老旧一氧化碳报警器。",{"_94":438},"2026-11-09T23:57:21.000Z","2026-11-10T00:58:31.993Z",[124,92,126],"yno6kcgniaxeetqa6g928wna4","Meta 推出轻量级 AI 模型 Muse Ember，跑分媲美 Claude Haiku 5.5，单任务成本仅 1/3","Meta 推出迄今最小、效率最高的模型 Muse Ember，在 Artificial Analysis 排行榜中表现媲美 Claude Haiku 5.5，单任务成本仅为其 1/3，并在多项测试中超越 GPT-6 Luna。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T00:59:26.907Z","2026-11-10T01:19:33.076Z",[268,185],"d4f8o2c9r7r8b7fsdqnpev3eu","据报道 Anthropic 推进 IPO，计划下周四或周五挂牌","据 The Wall Street Journal 报道，Anthropic 将在本周设定估值区间，计划下周四或周五开始交易。部分机构投资者正推动估值低于上周讨论的 1.5 万亿美元目标，该数字已低于几个月前传闻的 2 万亿美元。报道还提到其主要竞争对手 OpenAI 上周融资 110 亿美元后估值约为 1.25 万亿美元，低于其最初寻求的 200 亿美元融资规模。","报道汇总了 Anthropic IPO 时间表与估值分歧，并对照 OpenAI 最新融资估值，可帮助读者理解 AI 板块的市场情绪变化。",{"_94":196},"2026-11-10T01:27:12.000Z","2026-11-10T02:03:32.132Z",[90,126],"e60057mwacom4thn43un8gfas","MiniCPM-OCR 集成进 Docling","很高兴看到 MiniCPM-OCR 集成进 Docling！🚀💙 感谢让开源文档处理更加易用！🙌",{"_94":478},"2026-11-10T01:40:38.000Z","2026-11-10T02:03:34.622Z",[146,477,125],{"_106":469,"_108":469,"_110":470,"_112":471,"_114":472,"_116":86,"_117":473},"OpenBMB","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=0f090400f960fbf9 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1503637999535284230%2FZflGAHZW_bigger.jpg&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5d58307d0c8c011b 96w",[],{"_106":474,"_108":475,"_121":476,"_123":-5},"ふきゅう","Khaled865412521","Docling v2.149.0 just shipped and who should update depends on what you feed it 📄\n\nBuilding RAG over PDFs?\nNew opt-in --use-embedded-picture-images pulls a figure straight out of the PDF at native pixels instead of a rendered crop. If the region also holds text or vector shapes it falls back to the crop\n\nNeed OCR on one consumer GPU?\nNew minicpm_ocr preset for OpenBMB's 1.3B MiniCPM-OCR (English + Chinese):\ndocling doc.pdf --pipeline vlm --vlm-model minicpm_ocr\n\nTranscribing audio on a Mac?\nASR can now run on mlx-audio with no torch, and Granite Speech recordings get split into ~30s windows\n\n⚠️ Scripts: --vlm-model X now really switches to the VLM pipeline (it used to be silently ignored), and pairing it with --pipeline standard now errors\n\npip install -U docling\n\nhttps://github.com/docling-project/docling/releases/tag/v2.149.0","RAG","面壁智能 OpenBMB","r2mxmpiddonkhfsy6k2zr32dk","腾讯首款专属 AI 游戏陪伴 Agent“鹅次元”开启内测，支持实时陪聊与手机 QQ 陪伴","腾讯首款专属 AI 游戏陪伴 Agent“鹅次元”于 11 月 10 日开启内测，面向 PC 玩家提供拟人化 AI 陪伴和实时语音互动。该产品能识别用户游戏画面并据此互动，支持 PC / 手机 QQ 陪伴聊天，还具备桌宠、一键更换壁纸等功能。目前提供“夏夏”“沈露白”“谷雨”“贝拉”四个角色，擅长《无畏契约》《英雄联盟》《反恐精英》等游戏。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T01:43:25.860Z","2026-11-10T02:22:30.501Z",[146,91],"lko5m98q1kk1dlcjihvk527w8","Figma 官方讲解画布智能体的 6 种实用方法","Figma 官方介绍了在其画布上使用 Figma agent 的六种方法，覆盖从设计初期探索到交付前细节的各个阶段。","Figma 官方梳理了智能体在画布上的六种日常用法，含具体提示词示例，读者可直接照做提升设计工作流。",{"_94":495},"2026-11-09T21:46:00.000Z","2026-11-10T02:29:32.406Z",[124,91],67,"Figma AI / Agent / Make","y3k5kfq6bie1vvqpmtey93ibd","The Information：Nvidia 曾游说反对针对远程访问芯片的出口管制规则","The Information 援引两名现任美国商务部官员的话称，Nvidia 尤其大力游说反对任何针对远程访问的规则，而远程访问是中国 AI 实验室经由新加坡和马来西亚数据中心获取受限芯片的途径。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-10T02:27:35.000Z","2026-11-10T02:34:35.649Z",[90,430],{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":504,"_116":86,"_117":-5},[505],{"_222":251,"_224":506,"_226":507,"_228":508,"_230":509,"_232":510,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuuJ1cbEAAjFCK.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=d5b8dab6b4a3fe2c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuuJ1cbEAAjFCK.jpg&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=7f42fda875da8187","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuuJ1cbEAAjFCK.jpg&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=5fe5f26778971e7a 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuuJ1cbEAAjFCK.jpg&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=d5b8dab6b4a3fe2c 720w",890,1262,"l9q623ej4prg89hcxajl5ckx8","魅族 Flyme AIOS 官宣「超级 Aicy」上线：支持通话代接、出行管家与主动备车","魅族 Flyme AIOS 宣布「超级 Aicy」已上线，提供 24 小时在线的智能助手服务。其功能包括指定人、指定场景代接通话，高铁、飞机、酒店查询对比预定与打车导航，以及接入飞书套件的办公助手和股票数据查询。该助手还支持定时服务、问屏总结、视频生成，并深度集成 130+ 项手机原子能力，可主动备车调节车内环境。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T02:13:23.547Z","2026-11-10T02:43:30.588Z",[146],"i6uis8oxbtbkgr3udv2ngm6i1","OpenAI 部署控制室系统，35 秒内叫停失控 AI 智能体","OpenAI 宣布已在内部研究设施部署控制室系统，可在收到停止指令后最长 35 秒内阻止失控 AI 智能体继续输出。任务需先向控制室请求唯一任务 ID 并附加到推理请求，由控制室确认任务能否运行，停止时拒绝下一次推理请求。延迟源于推理授权请求的缓存层，公司正努力缩短至 0；所有前沿强化学习任务还配备独立模型监控器，发现潜在问题时发出警报。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T02:05:45.220Z","2026-11-10T02:43:30.603Z",[146,525,93],"安全/对齐","v6gx11iipuaxs3d55cws4hi2v","LongCat-2.5 免费上线 OpenCode","在 @opencode 上用 LongCat-2.5 构建你的下一个项目吧。现已免费开放！",{"_94":544},"2026-11-10T02:31:40.000Z","2026-11-10T02:52:34.458Z",[146],43,{"_106":535,"_108":536,"_110":537,"_112":538,"_114":539,"_116":86,"_117":540},"Meituan LongCat","Meituan_LongCat","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1961703766996258817%2Fkrp4C7yC_bigger.png&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5350a7de5264ad0c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1961703766996258817%2Fkrp4C7yC_bigger.png&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=2998f7a955a36171 48w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1961703766996258817%2Fkrp4C7yC_bigger.png&mode=avatar&exp=1796256000&sig=5350a7de5264ad0c 96w",[],{"_106":541,"_108":542,"_121":543,"_123":-5},"OpenCode","opencode","LongCat 2.5 is now free on OpenCode for two weeks\n\n- 1M Context\n- Multi-modal\n- Zero Data Retention","美团 LongCat","t3r8hpgvqjx6m5nntcvu0egd0","Azeem Azhar：AI 市场进入调整期，而非崩盘","Azeem Azhar 认为当前 AI 板块是\"向优质资产转移\"而非崩盘：截至 10 月的十二个月内 AI 收入达 1880 亿美元，年化 3450 亿美元，同比增长 4.2 倍。",{"_94":553},"2026-11-10T02:02:29.000Z","2026-11-10T03:02:32.753Z",[318,90,126],45,"Azeem Azhar：Exponential View","v2kttogijk2w2kuk3ip43brpo","蚂蚁灵波开源触觉基础模型 LingBot-Touch","蚂蚁灵波科技开源触觉基础模型 LingBot-Touch，基于近 5000 小时真实触觉数据预训练，覆盖磁触觉、视触觉和压阻式三类传感原理，输出统一触觉表征，可跨传感器、跨灵巧手、跨模型和跨任务复用。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T02:46:47.257Z","2026-11-10T03:25:31.219Z",[268,562,308],54,"开源/仓库","mna5obim9zs439keyauqnh8nb","Adobe 与迪士尼达成多年战略合作，将 Firefly 等 AI 工具推广至乐园和内容制作","Adobe 宣布与华特迪士尼达成多年战略合作，Adobe 成为迪士尼官方 AI 创新合作伙伴，计划将 AI 工具推广至主题乐园、内容制作和体育内容传播等领域。",{"_94":186},"2026-11-10T03:26:36.530Z","2026-11-10T03:46:31.092Z",[90],56,"pz5zq3nyrsf8za2qco82zd29p","IBM 拟将 Claude Mythos 集成进 Concert Protect","IBM 计划把 Anthropic 的 Claude Mythos 接入 IBM Concert Protect，用于在企业代码中排查未知漏洞。此前 Mythos 仅通过 Anthropic 受限防御项目 Project Glasswing 供 IBM 内部安全研究使用。",{"_94":216},"2026-11-10T04:04:27.000Z","2026-11-10T04:07:36.442Z",[90,525,126],{"_106":216,"_108":217,"_110":218,"_112":219,"_114":579,"_116":86,"_117":-5},[580],{"_222":251,"_224":581,"_226":582,"_228":583,"_230":584,"_232":585,"_234":-5,"_235":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuvG1tbAAAkov7.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=1efd84fa6ad1577c","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuvG1tbAAAkov7.png&mode=full&exp=1794528000&sig=983f25843b4ac1d8","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuvG1tbAAAkov7.png&mode=card&exp=1794528000&sig=2a0f001b2c9f196f 336w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fmedia%2FHWuvG1tbAAAkov7.png&mode=thumb&exp=1794528000&sig=1efd84fa6ad1577c 720w",878,779,"kgdokhk7o4z59i3paj05238bl","实测灰度中的 GPT-6.2 Sol：代码动画与 AI 剪辑能否追平 Opus 5.5","博主称已灰度抽到 GPT-6.2 Sol，用统一提示语在 Codex 中实测代码动画、3D 可视化、UI 生成和 AI 剪辑，并与 Opus 5.5 对比。结论是 6.2 Sol 的代码动画比 6.1 Sol 提升明显，部分画风能追平 Opus 5.5，AI 视频转场和画面连续性表现不输甚至更好；无 Skill 帮助下的剪辑画面分配能力可追上 Opus 5.5。",{"_94":594},"2026-11-10T04:01:00.000Z","2026-11-10T04:11:38.757Z",[124,93,126],53,"公众号：卡尔的AI沃茨","lwbznpwnu3d7avukt0arjc2go","Anthropic 员工推荐用一条提示词让 Claude Code 全面审查项目","作者转发 Anthropic 的 Alex Albert 分享的提示词：对每个项目运行同一条指令，让 Claude 通读整个项目，找出损坏、不一致、低效或不再需要的内容，确定的问题直接修复，其余列出供人工审查。作者补充可用 /doctor prompt-audit 和 /skill-doctor 优化上下文文件并清理不必要的技能。","这条提示词可直接复用，让 Claude 审查整个项目找出问题并修复或列出待审项，还附带了排查上下文文件的命令。",{"_94":127},"2026-11-10T04:17:59.000Z","2026-11-10T04:22:33.973Z",[124,92,126],65,{"_106":107,"_108":109,"_110":111,"_112":113,"_114":605,"_116":86,"_117":606},[],{"_106":119,"_108":120,"_121":607,"_123":608},"Every time we have a new model, I run the same simple prompt on all my projects:\n\n\"Read this entire project and find everything that’s broken, inconsistent, inefficient, or no longer needed. Fix what you’re sure about and list the rest for me to review.\"\n\nhighly recommend trying","每次我们有新模型，我都会在所有项目上运行同一个简单的提示词：\n\n“阅读整个项目，找出所有损坏、不一致、低效或不再需要的内容。修复你有把握的部分，其余的列出来供我审查。”\n\n强烈推荐试试","all","tag","q","tab","time",{"_615":616,"_617":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
